'''Gate number one''' was a boarding gate at the [[Glavis Ringworld starport|starport]] located on the ring world [[Glavis Ringworld]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. [[Star Liner Travel]]'s [[Flight 1020]] ran a non-stop service from Glavis Ringworld to [[Tatooine]], and used gate number one.<ref name="Return" />
